 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Try drawing the eyes from different angles, not just straight on. Look at the face from the side or the top, and draw the eye that way. That's usually the problem eye. Draw the right one from front on, and it will look more like the real thing. Draw a line across the face, connecting the top of one eye to the bottom of the other. The nostril should sit just inside that line. Good luck. Rough drawings like a warm up help a lot.",
